text:
I have updated the layout of the chat interfaces to display all chats in a single horizontal row with horizontal scrolling.

### Changes:
- **`ChatInterface.tsx`**: Replaced the responsive grid with a flex container that has `overflow-x-auto`. Each model container now has a width of `400px` (exceeding the requested 300px for better readability) and does not shrink, ensuring they stay on the same line.
- **`JokeInterface.tsx`**: Applied the same horizontal layout to the joke evaluation screen, ensuring consistency across the application.

Both sections now support horizontal scrolling when the number of selected models exceeds the available screen width.

